# Cursor Rules — BroxBhai

Always follow:
- `AGENTS.md`
- `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`
- `docs/CODING_CONVENTIONS.md`
- `docs/AI_CODING_GUIDE.md`

Hard rules:
- Don’t edit generated assets in `public_html/assets/**/dist/**` unless there is no source file.
- Prefer adding routes in `app/Controllers/*.php` using `$router->get/post/...`.
- Use prepared statements in Models; no raw SQL concatenation.
- Require CSRF validation for POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE endpoints.
- Keep changes minimal; do not refactor unrelated code.

When you change frontend source JS/CSS:
- Run `npm run build` (or `npm run dev`) and ensure corresponding dist outputs remain consistent.

